{"title": "Hellriders", "pageid": 35295, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Hellriders", "categories": ["Factions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Hellriders</b> are an elite cavalry unity and the primary armed force of <a href=\"/wiki/Elturel\" title=\"Elturel\">Elturel</a>. \n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>The Hellriders are well-known for their cavalry and handsome mounts. In the epilogue, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zevlor\" title=\"Zevlor\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Zevlor.png/25px-Portrait_Zevlor.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Zevlor.png/38px-Portrait_Zevlor.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Zevlor.png/50px-Portrait_Zevlor.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Zevlor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Zevlor.png/25px-Portrait_Zevlor.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Portrait_Zevlor.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Zevlor\" title=\"Zevlor\">Zevlor</a> reveals that the Hellriders <a href=\"/wiki/Oathbreaker\" title=\"Oathbreaker\">have no oath</a>. Their <a href=\"/wiki/Hellrider_Cleric\" title=\"Hellrider Cleric\">Hellrider Clerics</a> worshiped the lawful neutral deity <a href=\"/wiki/Helm_(deity)\" title=\"Helm (deity)\">Helm</a>, whose domains are <a href=\"/wiki/Life_Domain\" title=\"Life Domain\">Life</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Light_Domain\" title=\"Light Domain\">Light</a>, and Twilight. This makes sense as the Hellrider Cleric uses the subclass feature <a href=\"/wiki/Radiance_of_the_Dawn\" title=\"Radiance of the Dawn\">Radiance of the Dawn</a> of the Light Domain as well as Life Domain healing spells. As their deity's alignment is lawful neutral, they were likely <a href=\"/wiki/Oath_of_Devotion\" title=\"Oath of Devotion\">Oath of Devotion</a> Paladins in their antebellum.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>If <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zevlor\" title=\"Zevlor\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Zevlor.png/25px-Portrait_Zevlor.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Zevlor.png/38px-Portrait_Zevlor.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Zevlor.png/50px-Portrait_Zevlor.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Zevlor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Zevlor.png/25px-Portrait_Zevlor.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Portrait_Zevlor.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Zevlor\" title=\"Zevlor\">Zevlor</a> survives to Act Three, the party can summon Hellrider allies with the action <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellrider_Platoon\" title=\"Hellrider Platoon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/eb/Hellrider_Platoon_Icon.webp/25px-Hellrider_Platoon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/eb/Hellrider_Platoon_Icon.webp/38px-Hellrider_Platoon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/eb/Hellrider_Platoon_Icon.webp/50px-Hellrider_Platoon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellrider Platoon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/eb/Hellrider_Platoon_Icon.webp/25px-Hellrider_Platoon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/eb/Hellrider_Platoon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hellrider_Platoon\" title=\"Hellrider Platoon\">Hellrider Platoon</a> during their <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Confront_the_Elder_Brain\" title=\"Confront the Elder Brain\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"confrontation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Confront_the_Elder_Brain\" title=\"Confront the Elder Brain\">confrontation</a> with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Netherbrain\" title=\"The Netherbrain\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png/25px-Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png/38px-Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png/50px-Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elder Brain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png/25px-Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Netherbrain\" title=\"The Netherbrain\">Elder Brain</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Hellriders\">Notable Hellriders</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellrider_Cleric\" title=\"Hellrider Cleric\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Portrait_Hellrider_Cleric.png/30px-Portrait_Hellrider_Cleric.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Portrait_Hellrider_Cleric.png/45px-Portrait_Hellrider_Cleric.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Portrait_Hellrider_Cleric.png/60px-Portrait_Hellrider_Cleric.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellrider Cleric\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Portrait_Hellrider_Cleric.png/30px-Portrait_Hellrider_Cleric.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Portrait_Hellrider_Cleric.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hellrider_Cleric\" title=\"Hellrider Cleric\">Hellrider Cleric</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellrider_Paladin\" title=\"Hellrider Paladin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Portrait_Hellrider_Paladin.png/30px-Portrait_Hellrider_Paladin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Portrait_Hellrider_Paladin.png/45px-Portrait_Hellrider_Paladin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Portrait_Hellrider_Paladin.png/60px-Portrait_Hellrider_Paladin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellrider Paladin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Portrait_Hellrider_Paladin.png/30px-Portrait_Hellrider_Paladin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Portrait_Hellrider_Paladin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hellrider_Paladin\" title=\"Hellrider Paladin\">Hellrider Paladin</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href